              <p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-on-surface-variant max-w-md mx-auto">
                Discover handcrafted solitaire rings, pendants, and certified diamonds in our collection.
              </p>
              <div class="pt-2">
                <a href="/Product" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-primary hover:bg-primary-fixed text-on-primary font-label-md text-label-md font-bold transition-all shadow-[0_0_16px_rgba(212,175,55,0.3)]">
                  <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">diamond</span>
                  <span>Browse Fine Jewelry Catalog</span>
                </a>
